591
00:33:48,271 --> 00:33:51,687
My life back home
just feels like a constant...

592
00:33:51,771 --> 00:33:53,687
loop. [sighs]

593
00:33:53,771 --> 00:33:56,646
Dance is the only thing
that gives it meaning.

594
00:33:56,729 --> 00:33:58,062
And gives me some freedom.

595
00:33:59,479 --> 00:34:00,687
Then why stop?

596
00:34:00,771 --> 00:34:02,604
'Cause it's not up to me anymore.

597
00:34:03,646 --> 00:34:06,021
I'm sorry. My problems
probably sound so trivial.

598
00:34:06,104 --> 00:34:07,312
No, no, no, it's okay.

599
00:34:07,396 --> 00:34:09,271
I mean, rich girls can be sad, too.

600
00:34:09,354 --> 00:34:11,687
We should put that on a T-shirt.

601
00:34:11,771 --> 00:34:13,187
Yeah, we should do that.

602
00:34:13,271 --> 00:34:15,396
[laughs] What are you doing?

603
00:34:15,479 --> 00:34:16,812
Come on.

604
