your clothes off this time.

612
00:34:43,687 --> 00:34:45,687
[both laughing]

613
00:34:47,812 --> 00:34:49,062
Oh.

614
00:34:49,146 --> 00:34:50,771
Okay, truce, truce.

615
00:34:50,854 --> 00:34:51,896
