if she's staying
in a place like this, huh?

674
00:39:09,062 --> 00:39:10,521
[panting]

675
00:39:10,604 --> 00:39:12,562
[Julian groans]

676
00:39:12,646 --> 00:39:13,979
[grunts, coughs]

677
00:39:14,062 --> 00:39:15,854
