682
00:39:27,229 --> 00:39:31,062
[Isolde] <i>Just finalizing the deal
with the local landowner, but the hotel</i>

683
00:39:31,146 --> 00:39:32,896
will be built.

684
00:39:32,979 --> 00:39:34,687
So, let's talk about you.

685
00:39:34,771 --> 00:39:36,146
Did you take your pills this morning?

686
00:39:36,229 --> 00:39:38,354
Um...

687
00:39:38,437 --> 00:39:39,812
[Ry stammers]

688
00:39:39,896 --> 00:39:41,646
Uh, I'm just still
getting used to the new meds.

689
00:39:41,729 --> 00:39:43,229
You know how it is.

690
00:39:43,312 --> 00:39:44,771
Yeah, I'm sorry.

691
00:39:46,104 --> 00:39:48,146
I've been hanging out with Amara.

692
00:39:48,229 --> 00:39:49,354
From the front desk.

693
00:39:49,437 --> 00:39:50,812
Oh, right, yeah, yeah.

694
00:39:50,896 --> 00:39:51,979
And some of her friends.

695
00:39:52,062 --> 00:39:55,521
Well, as long as you're not falling
in love with some hot Spaniard.

696
00:39:56,521 --> 00:39:57,854
[chuckles]

697
00:39:58,896 --> 00:40:00,479
- What? Already?
- [chuckles]

698
00:40:00,562 --> 00:40:02,104
Okay. I'm not even gonna ask.

699
00:40:02,187 --> 00:40:05,146
But if you could peel yourself away
for a couple days,

700
00:40:05,229 --> 00:40:06,521
I could really use your help.

701
00:40:06,604 --> 00:40:10,021
Have your people call my people,
and maybe we'll figure something out.

702
00:40:10,104 --> 00:40:11,521
I'll do that.

703
