Unless of course we get to the good stuff,
then I can be quite possessive.

731
00:41:57,021 --> 00:41:59,396
Go, change! I want to hear
all about Julian the other night.

732
00:42:00,396 --> 00:42:01,646
- [chuckles]
- Go.

733
00:42:01,729 --> 00:42:03,646
So, who is this girl?

734
00:42:03,729 --> 00:42:07,562
Prisha. She's a medical student
visiting from London.

735
00:42:07,646 --> 00:42:09,021
How long is she here for?

736
00:42:09,104 --> 00:42:10,771
Uh, three weeks, I think.

737
00:42:10,854 --> 00:42:12,646
Oh, that's not long.

738
00:42:12,729 --> 00:42:14,521
What if you catch feelings?

739
00:42:14,604 --> 00:42:16,479
Just because something
doesn't last forever

740
00:42:16,562 --> 00:42:18,896
doesn't mean it's not worth experiencing.

741
00:42:18,979 --> 00:42:21,854
And anyway, this is a tourist island.

742
00:42:21,937 --> 00:42:24,854
- People come and go.
- Hmm.

743
00:42:24,937 --> 00:42:28,604
I mean, you won't be here forever,
and you still made out with J.

744
00:42:29,687 --> 00:42:31,646
- Ah! Knew it.
- [laughs]

745
00:42:31,729 --> 00:42:33,479
Locked lips with a scoundrel.

746
00:42:33,562 --> 00:42:36,187
It was just one kiss.

747
00:42:36,271 --> 00:42:38,146
And I haven't heard from him since.

748
00:42:39,146 --> 00:42:40,854
Oh.

749
00:42:40,937 --> 00:42:42,729
Are you that bad of a kisser?

750
00:42:42,812 --> 00:42:44,271
No.

751
00:42:44,354 --> 00:42:47,187
What? I'm just saying.
One kiss then nothing?

752
00:42:47,271 --> 00:42:48,437
No tongue?

753
00:42:48,521 --> 00:42:50,479
[gasps] Too much tongue?

754
00:42:50,562 --> 00:42:51,854
- Oh, God.
- [laughs]

755
00:42:51,937 --> 00:42:53,437
["Sufre Mamón" playing]

756
00:42:53,937 --> 00:42:55,812
[singing in Spanish to music]

757
00:42:55,896 --> 00:42:57,896
[lively chatter]

758
00:43:02,354 --> 00:43:06,312
Well, you've already seen him naked,
so you know what you are getting.

759
00:43:06,396 --> 00:43:07,646
Okay. Oh.

760
00:43:07,729 --> 00:43:09,687
There she is.

761
00:43:09,771 --> 00:43:11,646
- Do you want me to hang back?
- No, no.

762
00:43:11,729 --> 00:43:13,479
She could be dangerous.

763
00:43:13,562 --> 00:43:15,146
- [chuckles]
- Just...

764
00:43:15,229 --> 00:43:16,271
[Amara sighs]

765
00:43:18,312 --> 00:43:19,979
Uh, Prisha?

766
00:43:20,062 --> 00:43:21,187
- Amara. Hi.
- Hi.

767
00:43:21,271 --> 00:43:22,354
[both chuckle]

768
00:43:22,437 --> 00:43:25,104
Uh, this is Ry, my friend from Texas.

769
00:43:25,187 --> 00:43:27,312
- Oh, hi. Lovely to meet you.
- Hi. Nice to meet you.

770
00:43:27,396 --> 00:43:28,771
I hope it's not weird that I brought her.

