1658
01:34:32,104 --> 01:34:33,521
No, she doesn't.

1659
01:34:34,771 --> 01:34:36,437
She wouldn't blame you.

1660
01:34:38,646 --> 01:34:41,062
You know, I never planned to have a baby.

1661
01:34:42,604 --> 01:34:43,771
Wasn't on my list.

1662
01:34:43,854 --> 01:34:46,187
No.

1663
01:34:46,271 --> 01:34:50,771
If I remember correctly, you wanted
a mansion, three cars and a pony.

1664
01:34:52,646 --> 01:34:53,854
I never got the pony.

1665
01:34:55,062 --> 01:34:58,104
When I found out I was pregnant, I...

1666
01:34:58,187 --> 01:35:00,354
I felt like my life had purpose.

1667
01:35:02,229 --> 01:35:04,229
And I wanted her so bad.

1668
01:35:05,771 --> 01:35:08,396
And I thought I would just
take the chance.

1669
01:35:08,479 --> 01:35:11,687
And you have raised a strong young woman

1670
01:35:11,771 --> 01:35:13,937
and gave her a wonderful life.

1671
01:35:16,312 --> 01:35:20,146
So whatever happens, Izzy,
you have nothing to be ashamed of.

1672
01:35:21,854 --> 01:35:23,604
Hmm? Nothing.

1673
01:35:27,646 --> 01:35:29,604
[contemplative music playing]

1674
01:35:56,979 --> 01:35:58,937
♪ ♪

