01:36:02,146 --> 01:36:03,854
Hey, thanks for coming.

1676
01:36:03,937 --> 01:36:07,021
- No, of course.
- We have a lot of work to do.

1677
01:36:07,104 --> 01:36:08,896
Yeah, so we have a couple of solutions,

1678
01:36:08,979 --> 01:36:10,396
