Hey. Sit down. Sit down.

1685
01:36:45,646 --> 01:36:47,062
I...

1686
01:36:49,812 --> 01:36:52,562
I have something that belongs to you.

1687
01:36:54,729 --> 01:36:56,521
♪ ♪

1688
01:36:58,812 --> 01:37:00,937
When I was eight,

1689
01:37:01,021 --> 01:37:04,271
I found my father's letters
to his first love.

1690
01:37:05,646 --> 01:37:08,271
I always wondered who they were for.

1691
01:37:10,146 --> 01:37:13,271
And now I know who Izzy is.

1692
01:37:16,979 --> 01:37:18,187
[sighs]

1693
01:37:20,229 --> 01:37:21,771
[inhales]

1694
01:37:21,854 --> 01:37:23,229
[Isolde sighs]

