1699
01:37:33,521 --> 01:37:36,396
I haven't. There's been no-no change
with that, but...

1700
01:37:38,021 --> 01:37:41,437
...there has been a... a new development.

1701
01:37:48,396 --> 01:37:52,062
So you found a new plot of land
to build the hotel?

1702
01:37:54,937 --> 01:37:57,229
