1705
01:38:04,146 --> 01:38:05,312
You were right.

1706
01:38:05,396 --> 01:38:07,187
This is my home.

1707
01:38:08,187 --> 01:38:10,229
And I should be protecting it.

1708
01:38:10,312 --> 01:38:12,271
So...

1709
01:38:12,354 --> 01:38:15,021
