1710
01:38:15,104 --> 01:38:16,521
[chuckles softly]

1711
01:38:16,604 --> 01:38:18,604
It's what Ry would want.

1712
01:38:19,729 --> 01:38:21,687
It's what I want.

1713
01:38:23,229 --> 01:38:25,146
I think...

1714
01:38:25,229 --> 01:38:27,146
