one of these shirts, too.

1715
01:38:27,229 --> 01:38:28,396
[both chuckle]

1716
01:38:31,979 --> 01:38:34,271
Thank you, Izzy.

1717
01:38:34,354 --> 01:38:36,312
Can't wait to work together.

1718
01:38:38,312 --> 01:38:40,896
